ize: 32px; font-weight: 700; text-align: center; margin: 0 0 16px;\">Real DaVinci heart health formulations available for private label</h2>\n    <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 17px; text-align: center; max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto 48px;\">These are actual DaVinci products available for private label today. Browse the full catalog during your consultation.</p>\n    <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 24px;\">\n      <div style=\"background: white; border-radius: 8px; padding: 28px 26px; border: 1px solid #ebebe8; transition: box-shadow .2s;\">\n      <div style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 48px; height: 48px; background: #c9dbe2; border-radius: 10px; margin: 0 0 16px;\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#012638\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width:24px;height:24px;\"><path d=\"M21 8.25c0-2.49-2.02-4.5-4.5-4.5-1.83 0-3.4 1.09-4.13 2.66A4.49 4.49 0 0 0 7.5 3.75 4.5 4.5 0 0 0 3 8.25c0 6.97 9 12 9 12s9-5.03 9-12Z\"/></svg>\n      </div>\n      <p style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1.5px; margin: 0 0 8px;\">OMEGAS</p>\n      <h3 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 8px;\">Omega-3 1000™</h3>\n      <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.55; margin: 0 0 16px;\">Easy-to-swallow softgels rich in EPA and DHA from omega-3 fatty acids for cardiovascular health. No fishy aftertaste.</p>\n      <div><span style=\"display: inline-block; background: #f7f7f6; color: #012638; font-size: 12px; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 100px; margin: 0 4px 6px 0;\">EPA</span><span style=\"display: inline-block; background: #f7f7f6; color: #012638; font-size: 12px; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 100px; margin: 0 4px 6px 0;\">DHA</span></div>\n    </div><div style=\"background: white; border-radius: 8px; padding: 28px 26px; border: 1px solid #ebebe8; transition: box-shadow .2s;\">\n      <div style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 48px; height: 48px; background: #c9dbe2; border-radius: 10px; margin: 0 0 16px;\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#012638\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width:24px;height:24px;\"><path d=\"M3.75 13.5 13.5 3l-2.25 7.5h6L9 21l2.25-7.5h-7.5Z\"/></svg>\n      </div>\n      <p style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1.5px; margin: 0 0 8px;\">CELLULAR ENERGY</p>\n      <h3 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 8px;\">Coenzyme Q10 ChewMelt</h3>\n      <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.55; margin: 0 0 16px;\">Orange-flavored tablet with CoQ10 and Vitamin E for cardiovascular, liver and dental health.</p>\n      <div><span style=\"display: inline-block; background: #f7f7f6; color: #012638; font-size: 12px; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 100px; margin: 0 4px 6px 0;\">CoQ10</span><span style=\"display: inline-block; background: #f7f7f6; color: #012638; font-size: 12px; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 100px; margin: 0 4px 6px 0;\">Vit E</span></div>\n    </div><div style=\"background: white; border-radius: 8px; padding: 28px 26px; border: 1px solid #ebebe8; transition: box-shadow .2s;\">\n      <div style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 48px; height: 48px; background: #c9dbe2; border-radius: 10px; margin: 0 0 16px;\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#012638\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width:24px;height:24px;\"><path d=\"M9 12.75 11.25 15 15 9.75M21 12c0 5.31-3.69 9.76-8.65 10.95a.84.84 0 0 1-.4.05.94.94 0 0 1-.41-.05A11.25 11.25 0 0 1 3 12V5.99c0-.46.31-.87.74-1.05A23.95 23.95 0 0 1 12 3a23.95 23.95 0 0 1 8.26 1.94c.43.18.74.59.74 1.05V12Z\"/></svg>\n      </div>\n      <p style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1.5px; margin: 0 0 8px;\">UBIQUINOL</p>\n      <h3 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 8px;\">Ubiquinol 100 mg</h3>\n      <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.55; margin: 0 0 16px;\">Proprietary form of ubiquinol with superior bioavailability for cardiovascular, dental and overall health.</p>\n      <div><span style=\"display: inline-block; background: #f7f7f6; color: #012638; font-size: 12px; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 100px; margin: 0 4px 6px 0;\">Ubiquinol</span><span style=\"display: inline-block; background: #f7f7f6; color: #012638; font-size: 12px; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 100px; margin: 0 4px 6px 0;\">100mg</span></div>\n    </div><div style=\"background: white; border-radius: 8px; padding: 28px 26px; border: 1px solid #ebebe8; transition: box-shadow .2s;\">\n      <div style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 48px; height: 48px; background: #c9dbe2; border-radius: 10px; margin: 0 0 16px;\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#012638\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width:24px;height:24px;\"><path d=\"M8.59 12.41a6 6 0 0 1 8.49-8.49l-1.06 1.06m-4.94 11.42L8.59 12.41m6.36 6.36-3.32-3.32m-1.4-1.4a6 6 0 0 0-3.74 1.43A6 6 0 0 0 4 21l1.5-1.5m11.13-11.13L21 4\"/></svg>\n      </div>\n      <p style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1.5px; margin: 0 0 8px;\">BLOOD PRESSURE</p>\n      <h3 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 8px;\">BP Elite™</h3>\n      <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.55; margin: 0 0 16px;\">Unique herbal extract combination for healthy blood pressure, cardiovascular function and nitric oxide production.</p>\n      <div><span style=\"display: inline-bloc